{"beat": 26, "name": "THE STORE IN TOWN", "text": "Think about what that did to the general store in a farm town. It had a counter, a shelf, a credit book, and it had never competed with a catalogue on the price of moving a parcel, because before 1913 the catalogue couldn't move a parcel to the farm cheaply. Now it could. The customer did the arithmetic: the catalogue's price, plus the postage off the card, against the storekeeper's price. That's the sentence our historian wrote. The decline of the old general store began the day parcel post went into effect.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "Think", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16}, {"word": "about", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.42}, {"word": "what", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.64}, {"word": "that", "start": 0.64, "end": 0.86}, {"word": "did", "start": 0.86, "end": 1.12}, {"word": "to", "start": 1.12, "end": 1.32}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.32, "end": 1.46}, {"word": "general", "start": 1.46, "end": 1.76}, {"word": "store", "start": 1.76, "end": 2.18}, {"word": "in", "start": 2.18, "end": 2.44}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.44, "end": 2.62}, {"word": "farm", "start": 2.62, "end": 2.88}, {"word": "town.", "start": 2.88, "end": 3.32}, {"word": "It", "start": 4.02, "end": 4.18}, {"word": "had", "start": 4.18, "end": 4.32}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.32, "end": 4.46}, {"word": "counter,", "start": 4.46, "end": 4.82}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.42, "end": 5.54}, {"word": "shelf,", "start": 5.54, "end": 5.84}, {"word": "a", "start": 6.4, "end": 6.5}, {"word": "credit", "start": 6.5, "end": 6.78}, {"word": "book,", "start": 6.78, "end": 7.18}, {"word": "and", "start": 7.64, "end": 7.78}, {"word": "it", "start": 7.78, "end": 7.88}, {"word": "had", "start": 7.88, "end": 8.0}, {"word": "never", "start": 8.0, "end": 8.24}, {"word": "competed", "start": 8.24, "end": 8.82}, {"word": "with", "start": 8.82, "end": 9.1}, {"word": "a", "start": 9.1, "end": 9.22}, {"word": "catalogue", "start": 9.22, "end": 9.68}, {"word": "on", "start": 9